289 0 obj<</Subtype/Square/Rect[366 410 588 426]/T(AutoCAD SHX Text)/F 64/Contents(9.  THE FLOOR BELOW SHALL BE BACKPROPPED  THROUGH A MINIMUM OF TWO STOREYS BELOW. THIS RESULTS IN A MINIMUM OF THREE STOREYS PROPPED AT ALL TIMES.)/Border[0 0 0]/NM(LAGMHXCYCNMOOTCY)/M(D:20260730175612+10'00')/AP<</N 1284 0 R>>/RD[0 0 0 0]/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:contentType="text/html" xfa:APIVersion="BluebeamPDFRevu:2018" xfa:spec="2.2.0" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p>9.  THE FLOOR BELOW SHALL BE BACKPROPPED  THROUGH A MINIMUM OF TWO STOREYS BELOW. THIS RESULTS IN A MINIMUM OF THREE STOREYS PROPPED AT ALL TIMES.</p></body>)>>
endobj
